ng style, and I would like to ask you to draw it for me.\n\n\nAbout the character\nLeft eye: white (pupil white), right eye: green (pupil black)\nA girl with short brown hair and expressive face.\nWears boyish clothes with a high neck and black innerwear\nPiercing holes in both earlobes\nShe wears cat-shaped hairpins.\n(For more details, please see the attached image of the character details)\n\nAbout the use of illustrations\nI would like to use the illustration as an icon or header for SNS such as Twitter, YouTube, pixiv, etc.\n(I plan to use them on an account other than the one registered on skeb.)\n\n\nI will leave the composition and facial expressions up to you! I would be happy to draw whatever you would like, with your schedule and such as your first priority.\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/r76v27MNYpkGvLe88", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 407422, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "荒川とら", "screen_name": "_HPS8", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1664940953990475782/SPL3n_Yf.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/946407725382098944/1758677821/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 616482, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "氷室　5/5東2あ29a", "screen_name": "himuro11", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2010585776766210048/y3V9Pwh2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/343312550/1708870289/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": 84, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expi